otation when drawing with nodes in node drawing mode using the UI.\r\n\r\nSince we might have a `ScenePaint3DEditor` in the future, it will need to have similar randomization features to make the tool truly useful for level artists, such as when placing trees or any other objects, so I think this functionality should be added to 2D first.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes [Add the ability to randomize rotation and scale in 2D node drawing mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15439)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36ca110a-f67e-40e8-b410-e2913bbaf67f\r\n\r\nAI was used when writing some functions, for example `callable_mp(this, &ScenePaint2DEditor::_randomize_settings_pressed).call_deferred()`, since I have never used them inside the C++ api godot\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"logi